    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A celebration of pioneering 1980s games, this new-and-old collection of classic C64\u2122 games originally published by Cosmi includes a medieval styled remake of <i>Forbidden Forest</i> with all new graphics and audio, new comic book stories and remade box art, plus a trove of archival bonus material!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cosmi: Forbidden Forests</i> includes everything from pick-up-and-play shooters and platformers to adventure and simulation games with surprising depth. The games included are <i>Forbidden Forest</i>, <i>Beyond the Forbidden Forest</i>, <i>Aztec Challenge</i>, <i>Caverns of Khafka</i>, <i>Seal</i>, <i>Delta Man</i>, <i>Chomp!</i>, <i>Chernobyl: Nuclear Power Plant Simulation</i>, <i>Spite &amp; Malice</i>, and <i>Navcom 6: The Persian Gulf Defense</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 legendary games from the C64 era, including hits by master game designer Paul Norman.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bardcore-inspired Remake of Forbidden Forest with the ability to switch between the remade and original version in real time as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital Comics by Andy Lanning and Ant Williams bringing the world of the games to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save States and Rewind features powered by the Arsenal Engine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital gallery of development artifacts and advertisements from the original release of the games.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A celebration of pioneering 1980s games, this new-and-old collection of classic C64\u2122 games originally published by Cosmi includes a medieval styled remake of <i>Forbidden Forest</i> with all new graphics and audio, new comic book stories and remade box art, plus a trove of archival bonus material!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cosmi: Forbidden Forests</i> includes everything from pick-up-and-play shooters and platformers to adventure and simulation games with surprising depth. The games included are <i>Forbidden Forest</i>, <i>Beyond the Forbidden Forest</i>, <i>Aztec Challenge</i>, <i>Caverns of Khafka</i>, <i>Seal</i>, <i>Delta Man</i>, <i>Chomp!</i>, <i>Chernobyl: Nuclear Power Plant Simulation</i>, <i>Spite &amp; Malice</i>, and <i>Navcom 6: The Persian Gulf Defense</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 legendary games from the C64 era, including hits by master game designer Paul Norman.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bardcore-inspired Remake of Forbidden Forest with the ability to switch between the remade and original version in real time as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital Comics by Andy Lanning and Ant Williams bringing the world of the games to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save States and Rewind features powered by the Arsenal Engine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital gallery of development artifacts and advertisements from the original release of the games.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A celebration of pioneering 1980s games, this new-and-old collection of classic C64\u2122 games originally published by Cosmi includes a medieval styled remake of Forbidden Forest with all new graphics and audio, new comic book stories and remade box art, plus a trove of archival bonus material!",
